WEBVTT

00:01:44.420 --> 00:01:47.180
You've killed enough, no?

00:01:48.470 --> 00:01:50.750
That lantern...

00:01:51.170 --> 00:01:52.660
901...

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:57.660
O-Oreld!

00:01:57.660 --> 00:01:59.380
After fire, we have to deal with water now?!

00:01:59.540 --> 00:02:01.180
Everyone, get out from there!

00:02:03.130 --> 00:02:04.140
Corporal!

00:02:06.860 --> 00:02:08.440
908?

00:02:08.440 --> 00:02:11.980
I developed the "protective fluid", so I remember them.

00:02:11.980 --> 00:02:13.730
Protective fluid?

00:02:13.730 --> 00:02:17.040
They were made to wear the suits by believing in that lie.

00:02:17.390 --> 00:02:20.530
It's really just an anesthetic used to dull your senses.

00:02:21.380 --> 00:02:24.400
In other words, they can't really feel their own burns.

00:02:27.790 --> 00:02:32.040
He doesn't even know what's happening to his own body...

00:02:32.540 --> 00:02:34.460
...by using the flamethrower?

00:02:36.490 --> 00:02:37.440
2nd Lieutenant!

00:02:38.510 --> 00:02:40.530
If that guy shows up...

00:02:40.530 --> 00:02:42.620
Can you let me handle him?

00:02:43.580 --> 00:02:44.890
I beg of you!

00:02:59.790 --> 00:03:01.820
We've been waiting for you.

00:03:15.110 --> 00:03:20.050
We are all servants of the Silver Wheel.

00:03:27.610 --> 00:03:30.680
We are all-

00:03:30.680 --> 00:03:31.560
Mione.

00:03:33.020 --> 00:03:36.350
Only members address each other with those words.

00:03:37.260 --> 00:03:40.400
I recall already explaining that to you previously.

00:03:41.510 --> 00:03:42.780
Forgive me!

00:03:52.480 --> 00:03:53.390
Hans.

00:03:53.760 --> 00:03:55.250
How are you doing?

00:03:56.170 --> 00:03:58.990
We're having you perform a rather dull task right now.

00:04:00.250 --> 00:04:03.540
You gave me a place to stay.

00:04:04.350 --> 00:04:06.540
I'm thankful.

00:04:11.220 --> 00:04:15.690
I'm much more useful than that useless scum!

00:04:16.340 --> 00:04:18.240
Under your orders,

00:04:18.240 --> 00:04:20.260
I've distributed Himmel to the sewers...

00:04:20.260 --> 00:04:22.860
...and even made the documents you wanted!

00:04:25.290 --> 00:04:27.390
Would you like me to offer words of praise?

00:04:28.270 --> 00:04:30.290
That's not what I...

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:47.150
Then continue doing what you have been doing.

00:04:47.560 --> 00:04:49.390
That is your next quota.

00:04:49.860 --> 00:04:54.100
You will distribute the Himmel as you're told.

00:04:55.210 --> 00:04:56.860
Fare thee well, then.

00:04:58.190 --> 00:05:01.250
Protect Mione well.

00:05:27.380 --> 00:05:29.620
Just now... was that a gunshot?

00:05:29.970 --> 00:05:32.070
I couldn't hear anything, but...

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:37.940
Corporal, we'll continue our argument later.

00:05:38.420 --> 00:05:39.930
But, 2nd Lieutenant...

00:05:39.930 --> 00:05:41.530
Machs, get going.

00:05:41.530 --> 00:05:42.450
Yes, sir.

00:06:15.580 --> 00:06:16.770
Ah, gosh!

00:06:16.770 --> 00:06:17.970
Do as you like!

00:06:18.420 --> 00:06:19.520
Lieutenant!

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:20.860
But can you pull the trigger?

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:25.800
Inside, you don't really want to fight him, right?

00:06:28.400 --> 00:06:31.670
You're... my...

00:06:34.570 --> 00:06:35.330
Corporal!

00:06:35.510 --> 00:06:36.610
You mustn't hesitate!

00:06:36.610 --> 00:06:38.910
He's not someone you can let your guard down against!

00:06:40.480 --> 00:06:43.310
We're... on the same side...

00:06:43.960 --> 00:06:45.540
901...

00:06:46.720 --> 00:06:48.920
I'm not 901...

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.390
I'm part of...

00:06:55.380 --> 00:06:56.270
Then...

00:07:05.370 --> 00:07:06.230
2nd Lieutenant.

00:07:08.580 --> 00:07:09.930
I am ready...

00:07:11.350 --> 00:07:12.490
...to fight...

00:07:27.130 --> 00:07:28.030
Don't move.

00:07:29.970 --> 00:07:31.250
I said don't move!

00:07:41.660 --> 00:07:43.850
I told you not to move.

00:07:44.950 --> 00:07:47.690
I usually ask everyone to leave,

00:07:47.690 --> 00:07:51.590
but I'm really hoping for some reward now.

00:07:51.590 --> 00:07:53.170
Such as?

00:07:53.170 --> 00:07:54.360
That's obvious.

00:07:54.900 --> 00:07:59.740
I do think it's about time you recommend me to your main headquarters.

00:07:59.940 --> 00:08:03.440
Yes, to the Society of the Silver Wheel!

00:08:11.030 --> 00:08:12.020
Boss!

00:08:12.020 --> 00:08:12.970
What are you talking about?!

00:08:13.210 --> 00:08:15.470
Let's kill him already!

00:08:15.950 --> 00:08:19.590
This guy was going to burn the hell out of us in the sewers!

00:08:20.040 --> 00:08:23.020
Boss, who is this guy?!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.250
Is he one of us?!

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.890
That dude with the mask?

00:08:25.890 --> 00:08:29.100
They're the ones that flooded us, right?

00:08:29.100 --> 00:08:30.930
That's what you told us, Boss, right?

00:08:30.930 --> 00:08:33.150
Let's kill both of them!

00:08:33.150 --> 00:08:35.330
Hold your horses and be patient.

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:38.780
Let me hear your answer now.

00:08:39.510 --> 00:08:43.410
I'm the only one who can stop them.

00:08:44.240 --> 00:08:45.320
Hans,

00:08:46.090 --> 00:08:51.340
I'm really sorry for making you waste your talents here for so long.

00:08:52.510 --> 00:08:55.090
What are you talking about?

00:08:55.090 --> 00:08:57.140
I want to hear your response!

00:08:57.350 --> 00:09:00.660
Hey, I'm your master right now.

00:09:00.660 --> 00:09:02.520
Listen to me!

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:06.110
You take aim at the emissary, as well.

00:09:06.490 --> 00:09:07.830
Take your stance.

00:09:11.460 --> 00:09:12.980
Do it!

00:09:13.750 --> 00:09:18.200
Hans, your duty is to protect Mione.

00:09:19.110 --> 00:09:20.380
I understand.

00:09:21.140 --> 00:09:24.800
I prioritize your orders above all else.

00:09:25.460 --> 00:09:27.080
I promised.

00:09:28.330 --> 00:09:30.200
Good boy...

00:09:31.400 --> 00:09:33.290
Compared to you...

00:09:43.340 --> 00:09:47.480
...these people do not speak with any manners or intelligence.

00:09:48.650 --> 00:09:50.470
Incompetence is a sin.

00:09:54.980 --> 00:09:58.530
I thought it was a good opportunity to teach them that.

00:09:59.650 --> 00:10:02.550
Do you have any objections, Mione?

00:10:03.200 --> 00:10:04.120
Why you!!!

00:10:04.120 --> 00:10:05.060
Stop!

00:10:05.060 --> 00:10:06.410
Throw your guns away!

00:10:06.410 --> 00:10:07.860
Boss!

00:10:07.860 --> 00:10:10.670
Emissary, I beg you to stop.

00:10:11.760 --> 00:10:14.340
P-Please forgive my in-insolence... I...

00:10:16.040 --> 00:10:18.580
I will be seeing you in two weeks then.

00:10:20.150 --> 00:10:24.180
You're... going to forgive me?

00:10:24.890 --> 00:10:29.270
I simply punished those who lacked proper speaking manners.

00:10:29.430 --> 00:10:33.960
Emissary... I will continue to fulfill my duty...

00:10:33.960 --> 00:10:36.360
I will serve all of you...

00:10:36.360 --> 00:10:38.950
That's all I can do for you...

00:10:38.950 --> 00:10:42.340
Please keep everything that happened as a secret...

00:10:42.340 --> 00:10:43.780
Are you sure, Boss?

00:10:44.400 --> 00:10:47.650
Aren't we the ones being kept here and being wasted by them?

00:10:48.820 --> 00:10:52.170
You should be thankful for the fact that we're still alive.

00:10:52.600 --> 00:10:55.470
We shouldn't have stood up against them.

00:10:55.880 --> 00:10:57.010
I...

00:11:20.600 --> 00:11:22.410
Documents?

00:11:22.610 --> 00:11:23.740
Yeah.

00:11:24.290 --> 00:11:26.360
Do you remember something like that?

00:11:28.540 --> 00:11:30.330
I don't know about documents,

00:11:30.330 --> 00:11:33.790
but all of us were given one of these.

00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.320
This is...!

00:11:44.150 --> 00:11:47.010
Boss, something fishy's going on.

00:11:47.520 --> 00:11:49.310
Ah, welcome back.

00:11:50.400 --> 00:11:52.160
There's lipstick on your face!

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:53.180
Why?

00:11:53.180 --> 00:11:54.150
You were supposed to be getting information!

00:11:54.150 --> 00:11:55.000
The 1st Mechanized Unit has been dispatched.

00:11:55.000 --> 00:11:56.980
Gosh, where were you and what were you doing?!

00:11:57.440 --> 00:11:57.460
Full loadouts, too.

00:11:57.460 --> 00:11:58.610
You're hopeless, Oreld.
Full loadouts, too.

00:11:58.860 --> 00:12:00.990
Are you listening?!

00:12:00.990 --> 00:12:03.710
The number one broadsword of Imperial S.S. I,

00:12:04.430 --> 00:12:07.030
a unit whose purpose is to assault and annihilate:

00:12:07.030 --> 00:12:08.590
Claymore One.

00:12:11.520 --> 00:12:14.190
Things are definitely fishy now.

00:12:24.980 --> 00:12:26.060
This sound's...

00:12:44.970 --> 00:12:46.890
Claymore One!

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:48.160
Section I!

00:12:48.340 --> 00:12:49.530
Find the documents!

00:12:49.530 --> 00:12:51.120
Eliminate all that oppose!

00:12:53.360 --> 00:12:54.620
Opposition confirmed.

00:12:54.620 --> 00:12:55.420
Eliminating.

00:12:55.990 --> 00:12:57.240
Opposition confirmed.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:58.090
Eliminating.

00:12:59.960 --> 00:13:02.030
Documents not found.

00:13:02.030 --> 00:13:04.540
Documents not found, either.

00:13:04.540 --> 00:13:05.630
Stop!

00:13:29.260 --> 00:13:30.300
Hey, you!

00:13:30.300 --> 00:13:31.400
Where are the documents?!

00:13:35.810 --> 00:13:36.680
Out of the way!

00:13:39.800 --> 00:13:40.590
Opposition confirmed.

00:13:40.850 --> 00:13:41.760
Eliminating.

00:13:51.220 --> 00:13:52.740
What is this guy?!

00:13:53.280 --> 00:13:54.600
Break out the AP shells.

00:13:55.560 --> 00:13:57.210
Why are you protecting me?

00:13:57.680 --> 00:13:58.560
Protect you.

00:13:59.230 --> 00:14:00.360
My mission.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:02.700
Stand up quickly.

00:14:03.450 --> 00:14:07.320
They are coming soon.

00:14:08.150 --> 00:14:09.460
They?

00:14:13.170 --> 00:14:14.240
LT!

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.580
What's going on here?

00:14:15.800 --> 00:14:17.890
H-Help!

00:14:23.720 --> 00:14:25.340
The Assault Unit...

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:27.680
Against amateurs, they're...

00:14:28.500 --> 00:14:29.350
Who's there?!

00:14:32.540 --> 00:14:34.140
What, Section III?

00:14:34.140 --> 00:14:36.790
What business does the lowly Section III have here?

00:14:36.790 --> 00:14:39.180
This area is Section I's operational area.

00:14:39.180 --> 00:14:40.650
Leave immediately.

00:14:44.500 --> 00:14:45.150
Machs.

00:14:46.170 --> 00:14:48.140
We're dealing with Section I, you know?

00:14:49.360 --> 00:14:50.280
Machs!!!

00:14:50.880 --> 00:14:51.610
Y-Yes, sir!

00:14:51.610 --> 00:14:52.320
Hey! Hold it!

00:14:54.890 --> 00:14:56.450
Report to HQ immediately.

00:14:56.450 --> 00:14:58.330
We have intruders inside mission area.

00:14:58.330 --> 00:14:59.880
Requesting permission to eliminate.

00:14:59.880 --> 00:15:01.250
Intruders are army soldiers,

00:15:01.700 --> 00:15:04.670
Imperial S.S. III - Pumpkin Scissors!

00:15:09.370 --> 00:15:10.920
Get your commander out here!

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:13.410
Stop this massacre at once!

00:15:33.710 --> 00:15:34.320
Corporal!

00:15:34.600 --> 00:15:35.850
Hold it right there!

00:15:35.850 --> 00:15:36.550
Stop.

00:15:36.550 --> 00:15:38.580
We haven't received permission to eliminate them yet.

00:15:40.300 --> 00:15:41.770
Go with him, Machs.

00:15:46.530 --> 00:15:48.450
The corporal said he'll fight.

00:15:49.100 --> 00:15:52.430
Mione should be right next to his opponent.

00:15:53.020 --> 00:15:54.600
You go secure him.

00:15:54.600 --> 00:15:55.430
And you, LT?

00:15:56.540 --> 00:16:00.050
I must teach these foolish people a lesson.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:22.800
Don't worry about me. Go.

00:16:22.800 --> 00:16:23.730
But!

00:16:23.730 --> 00:16:24.460
Go!

00:16:24.460 --> 00:16:26.670
We're being taken pretty lightly, aren't we?

00:16:27.180 --> 00:16:29.250
Does she think we won't do anything
just because we're in the army, as well?

00:16:29.950 --> 00:16:31.250
LT...

00:16:32.600 --> 00:16:33.920
I don't know why...

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:38.210
...but for the first time, the Corporal...

00:16:38.960 --> 00:16:42.620
I believe he has faith in me tonight.

00:16:46.310 --> 00:16:47.310
Godspeed.

00:16:50.900 --> 00:16:51.820
Why you...

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:56.740
Really...

00:16:58.470 --> 00:17:01.390
Corporal, ever since you joined us,

00:17:01.390 --> 00:17:06.030
the easy-going and cheery Section III
has been full of violent events.

00:17:17.680 --> 00:17:20.630
The Thirteen Appointed Families...

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:24.520
...was the title bestowed upon those who have volunteered great contributions to the Empire.

00:17:25.240 --> 00:17:27.390
The title given to the Malvin family was "L."

00:17:27.850 --> 00:17:29.900
The Slasher, L.

00:17:31.850 --> 00:17:33.360
On the battlefield,

00:17:33.360 --> 00:17:35.740
the title given to the vanguard knights...

00:17:36.140 --> 00:17:37.110
...that slash open a pathway

00:17:39.880 --> 00:17:42.290
Come at me if you dare!

00:18:05.770 --> 00:18:06.580
Corporal!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.810
Sergeant Major Machs.

00:18:09.340 --> 00:18:11.020
Where did Mione go?

00:18:11.020 --> 00:18:15.860
There haven't been any other apparent escape routes so far.

00:18:16.790 --> 00:18:19.900
They must have gone down to the sewers.

00:18:22.140 --> 00:18:25.290
The sewers... down here, eh?

00:18:25.800 --> 00:18:26.840
Wait.

00:18:28.980 --> 00:18:30.230
I was careless.

00:18:30.870 --> 00:18:34.340
We shouldn't go any further from the lieutenant.

00:18:35.220 --> 00:18:38.140
If you trusted her, then don't worry about her.

00:18:38.140 --> 00:18:40.340
The LT will be fine.

00:18:41.260 --> 00:18:43.990
She's a soldier and a noble besides.

00:18:44.470 --> 00:18:45.240
Elimination,

00:18:45.620 --> 00:18:48.910
in other words, voluntarily opening fire would require permission.

00:18:49.640 --> 00:18:51.550
Even for Major Connelly,

00:18:52.690 --> 00:18:55.380
he'd need at least one hour for all the paperwork to go through his superiors.

00:18:56.990 --> 00:18:58.820
At least for one hour,

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:03.080
Section I soldiers won't be able to fire against the LT.

00:19:04.260 --> 00:19:06.540
Everything will be okay if we come back by then.

00:19:17.870 --> 00:19:20.200
But there's no way she can fight by herself for one hour.

00:19:20.860 --> 00:19:22.160
Fatigue will ensue.

00:19:30.240 --> 00:19:31.270
That's good enough.

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:34.270
If she doesn't resist, she'll only be arrested.

00:19:34.850 --> 00:19:37.300
But the person back there...

00:19:40.190 --> 00:19:41.560
...is Alice L. Malvin.

00:19:44.770 --> 00:19:45.940
Because it's her...

00:19:47.100 --> 00:19:49.660
She's a person that will slash her sword
and will not let evil pass before her eyes.

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:52.420
She won't give up her sword.

00:19:54.970 --> 00:19:56.130
Boss!

00:19:56.680 --> 00:19:58.250
Movement again.

00:19:58.250 --> 00:20:00.170
Is that more lipstick on your face?

00:20:00.430 --> 00:20:02.500
Now's not the time for that!

00:20:02.500 --> 00:20:04.430
The army heads are in commotion.

00:20:05.260 --> 00:20:06.590
The army heads?

00:20:06.590 --> 00:20:08.830
Ever since Section I's hound came back,

00:20:08.830 --> 00:20:11.750
Major Connelly has been in talks with them.

00:20:12.770 --> 00:20:15.600
Alice must've taken action.

00:20:15.600 --> 00:20:20.280
And so, it's probably a request for permission to open fire.

00:20:20.280 --> 00:20:22.030
Open fire?

00:20:22.030 --> 00:20:23.600
On our own men?

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:26.450
Even Claymore One has been dispatched.

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.360
Connelly would do something like that.

00:20:29.360 --> 00:20:30.750
How could he...

00:20:31.360 --> 00:20:32.750
What are we going to do, Boss?

00:20:34.060 --> 00:20:37.310
Let's go have a chat with Connelly.

00:20:51.130 --> 00:20:53.130
Corporal Randel Oland.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:20:59.080
You have given me...

00:20:59.900 --> 00:21:01.540
...a battlefield!

00:21:15.390 --> 00:21:16.670
I'm back.

00:21:18.060 --> 00:21:19.670
Where have you been all this time?

00:21:21.510 --> 00:21:23.670
Get that to the analysis crew.

00:21:25.100 --> 00:21:26.600
What is this?

00:21:27.210 --> 00:21:28.680
Parts of an experimental subject.

00:21:31.090 --> 00:21:34.230
Blood, skin, hair, nail...

00:21:35.210 --> 00:21:37.320
I plucked them off the subject.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:41.790
Then, these are 901's...

00:21:42.870 --> 00:21:43.830
Yes.

00:21:45.250 --> 00:21:47.090
By tomorrow morning...

00:21:48.450 --> 00:21:51.240
Either 901 or 908...

00:21:54.040 --> 00:21:57.220
We'll be getting a sample from one of them.

00:23:31.060 --> 00:23:32.330
Mer-kun, can you see?

00:23:32.330 --> 00:23:34.260
The small flame that floats in the darkness.

00:23:34.260 --> 00:23:36.430
I wonder what they look like in the corporal's eyes.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:38.220
And those flames...

00:23:39.260 --> 00:23:41.940
Next time, "The Darkness That Still Cannot be Saved."

00:23:41.940 --> 00:23:44.000
Come get us if you're not scared!
